msgstr[3] "figurki T-reksa"

#. ~ Description of variant "T-rex figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A relatively large plastic figurine of a T-rex."
msgstr "Stosunkowo duża plastikowa figurka T-reksa."

