msgid_plural "video game figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka z gry wideo"
msgstr[1] "figurki z gry wideo"
msgstr[2] "figurek z gry wideo"
msgstr[3] "figurki z gry wideo"

#. ~ Description of variant "video game figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large figurine of a video game character, holding a massive Gatling gun in "
"his giant arms."
msgstr ""
"Duża figurka postaci z gry wideo, trzymającej w olbrzymich ramionach ogromny "
"karabin Gatlinga."

#. ~ Variant name of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "zombie figurine"
msgid_plural "zombie figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka zombie"
msgstr[1] "figurki zombie"
msgstr[2] "figurek zombie"
msgstr[3] "figurki zombie"

#. ~ Description of variant "zombie figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A nasty looking figurine of a mutant zombie, with a large tongue sprouting "
"from its face.  You thankfully haven't encountered something like that yet."
msgstr ""
"Paskudnie wyglądająca figurka zmutowanego zombie z wielkim językiem "
"wyrastającym z twarzy. Na szczęście nie spotkałeś jeszcze czegoś takiego."

#. ~ Variant name of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "alien figurine"
msgid_plural "alien figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka kosmity"
msgstr[1] "figurki kosmity"
msgstr[2] "figurek kosmity"
msgstr[3] "figurki kosmity"

#. ~ Description of variant "alien figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"An expensive looking figurine of a gnarly, jet-black alien covered in "
"menacing looking spines."
msgstr ""
"Drogo wyglądająca figurka paskudnego, kruczoczarnego kosmity pokrytego "
"groźnie wyglądającymi kolcami."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "figurine"
msgid_plural "figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka"
msgstr[1] "figurki"
msgstr[2] "figurek"
msgstr[3] "figurki"

#. ~ Description of "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A normal-sized manufactured figurine.  This is the default variant, if you "
"see it something went wrong."
msgstr ""
"Fabryczna figurka normalnej wielkości. To domyślny wariant – jeśli go "
"widzisz, coś poszło nie tak."

#. ~ Variant name of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "swordsman figurine"
msgid_plural "swordsman figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka szermierza"
msgstr[1] "figurki szermierza"
msgstr[2] "figurek szermierza"
msgstr[3] "figurki szermierza"

#. ~ Description of variant "swordsman figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A figurine of some unnamed swordsman, covered with scars and equipped with "
"sturdy leather armor.  Seems to be ready to fight."
msgstr ""
"Figurka jakiegoś bezimiennego szermierza, pokrytego bliznami i odzianego w "
"solidny skórzany pancerz. Wygląda na gotowego do walki."

#. ~ Variant name of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "fashionable doll"
msgid_plural "fashionable dolls"
msgstr[0] "modna lalka"
msgstr[1] "modne lalki"
msgstr[2] "modnych lalek"
msgstr[3] "modnej lalki"

#. ~ Description of variant "fashionable doll" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A plastic figurine of a young woman.  She's meant to be dressed up and "
"accessorized with a wide variety of clothing, sold separately."
msgstr ""
"Plastikowa figurka młodej kobiety. Można ją przebierać i dodawać jej dodatki "
"z szerokiej gamy ubrań, sprzedawanych osobno."

#. ~ Variant name of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "nightmare figurine"
msgid_plural "nightmare figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka z koszmaru"
msgstr[1] "figurki z koszmaru"
msgstr[2] "figurek z koszmaru"
msgstr[3] "figurki z koszmaru"

#. ~ Description of variant "nightmare figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A plastic figurine with a nightmarish, scarred face.  He wears a hat and has "
"three long blades extending from a glove on the back of his hand."
msgstr ""
"Plastikowa figurka z koszmarną, pokrytą bliznami twarzą. Postać nosi "
"kapelusz, a z rękawicy na wierzchu jej dłoni wystają trzy długie ostrza."

#. ~ Variant name of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "unicorn figurine"
msgid_plural "unicorn figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka jednorożca"
msgstr[1] "figurki jednorożca"
msgstr[2] "figurek jednorożca"
msgstr[3] "figurki jednorożca"

#. ~ Description of variant "unicorn figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A figurine of a blue unicorn.  It is in a sitting position, shyly covering "
"both eyes with its front hooves."
msgstr ""
"Figurka niebieskiego jednorożca. Siedzi, nieśmiało zasłaniając oczy przednimi"
" kopytami."

#. ~ Variant name of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "swamp monster figurine"
msgid_plural "swamp monster figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka potwora z bagien"
msgstr[1] "figurki potwora z bagien"
msgstr[2] "figurek potwora z bagien"
msgstr[3] "figurki potwora z bagien"

#. ~ Description of variant "swamp monster figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A figurine of a scaly green swamp monster emerging from some fetid lagoon."
msgstr ""
"Figurka łuskowatego zielonego potwora z bagien, wyłaniającego się z jakiejś "
"cuchnącej laguny."

#. ~ Variant name of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "reaper figurine"
msgid_plural "reaper figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka ponurego żniwiarza"
msgstr[1] "figurki ponurego żniwiarza"
msgstr[2] "figurek ponurego żniwiarza"
msgstr[3] "figurki ponurego żniwiarza"

#. ~ Description of variant "reaper figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"Your heart leaps to your throat as you see the face of Death itself staring "
"back at you, scythe raised for the harvest!  You relax significantly once you"
" realize it's only a few inches tall and made of plastic."
msgstr ""
"Serce podchodzi ci do gardła, gdy widzisz wpatrzone w ciebie oblicze samej "
"Śmierci, z kosą wzniesioną do żniw! Odprężasz się znacznie, gdy zdajesz sobie"
" sprawę, że ma zaledwie kilka cali wysokości i jest z plastiku."

#. ~ Variant name of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "mermaid figurine"
msgid_plural "mermaid figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka syrenki"
msgstr[1] "figurki syrenki"
msgstr[2] "figurek syrenki"
msgstr[3] "figurki syrenki"

#. ~ Description of variant "mermaid figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A figurine of a redheaded mermaid sitting on a rock.  Like in the film this "
"toy is based on, she gazes longingly out to a world she wants to be a part of"
" - or she would be, but the face isn't drawn very well and doesn't express "
"much emotion at all."
msgstr ""
"Figurka rudowłosej syrenki siedzącej na skale. Podobnie jak w filmie, na "
"którym oparto tę zabawkę, tęsknie spogląda w stronę świata, którego chce być "
"częścią – a przynajmniej tak by było, gdyby twarz nie była namalowana tak "
"kiepsko i wyrażała choć trochę emocji."

#. ~ Variant name of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "avocado figurine"
msgid_plural "avocado figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka awokado"
msgstr[1] "figurki awokado"
msgstr[2] "figurek awokado"
msgstr[3] "figurki awokado"

#. ~ Description of variant "avocado figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A plastic figurine of an anthropomorphic avocado, holding a salt shaker and a"
" spoon.  Makes a great gift for the guacamole lover in your life, or as a "
"decoration for your kitchen."
msgstr ""
"Plastikowa figurka uczłowieczonego awokado trzymającego solniczkę i łyżkę. "
"Świetny prezent dla miłośnika guacamole w twoim życiu albo ozdoba do kuchni."

#. ~ Variant name of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "superhero figurine"
msgid_plural "superhero figurines"
msgstr[0] "figurka superbohatera"
msgstr[1] "figurki superbohatera"
msgstr[2] "figurek superbohatera"
msgstr[3] "figurki superbohatera"

#. ~ Description of variant "superhero figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A superhero action figure.  Its limbs can be adjusted for different poses, "
"and it is designed to do battle against a wide variety of crooks and "
"supervillains, sold separately."
msgstr ""
"Ruchoma figurka superbohatera. Jej kończyny można ustawiać w różnych pozach, "
"a zaprojektowano ją do walki z szeroką gamą oprychów i superzłoczyńców, "
"sprzedawanych osobno."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "yoyo"
msgid_plural "yoyos"
msgstr[0] "jo-jo"
msgstr[1] "jo-jo"
msgstr[2] "jo-jo"
msgstr[3] "jo-jo"

#. ~ Description of "yoyo"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A simple yoyo on a string.  Now you can be bored with style."
msgstr "Proste jo-jo na sznurku. Teraz możesz nudzić się z klasą."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "fidget spinner"
msgid_plural "fidget spinners"
msgstr[0] "fidget spinner"
msgstr[1] "fidget spinnery"
msgstr[2] "fidget spinnerów"
msgstr[3] "fidget spinnera"

#. ~ Description of "fidget spinner"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fidget spinner.  An artifact from when the times were simpler."
msgstr "Fidget spinner. Artefakt z czasów, gdy wszystko było prostsze."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "fidget spinner"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Spin"
msgstr "Zakręć"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_spinner_spinning" in use action of
#. item "fidget spinner"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "You spin your fidget spinner."
msgstr "Kręcisz swoim fidget spinnerem."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "imperfect doll"
msgid_plural "imperfect dolls"
msgstr[0] "niedoskonała lalka"
msgstr[1] "niedoskonałe lalki"
msgstr[2] "niedoskonałych lalek"
msgstr[3] "niedoskonałej lalki"

#. ~ Description of "imperfect doll"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"Its legs are mismatched, its arms misshapen, its eyes more crooked than its "
"smile.  Everywhere, it sparkles with the golden thread that has put it back "
"together.  It's beautiful."
msgstr ""
"Ma niedopasowane nogi i koślawe ręce, a oczy jeszcze bardziej krzywe niż "
"uśmiech. Cała połyskuje złotą nicią, która z powrotem ją poskładała. Jest "
"piękna."

#. ~ "description" action message of item "imperfect doll"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Hug the imperfect doll."
msgstr "Przytul niedoskonałą lalkę."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "floppy cotton legs"
msgid_plural "floppy cotton legs"
msgstr[0] "para wiotkich bawełnianych nóżek"
msgstr[1] "pary wiotkich bawełnianych nóżek"
msgstr[2] "par wiotkich bawełnianych nóżek"
msgstr[3] "pary wiotkich bawełnianych nóżek"

#. ~ Description of "floppy cotton legs"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"They're different colors and different lengths.  It would be hard to run away"
" with these."
msgstr ""
"Są w różnych kolorach i mają różną długość. Trudno byłoby na nich uciec."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "threadbare cotton arms"
msgid_plural "threadbare cotton arms"
msgstr[0] "para wytartych bawełnianych rączek"
msgstr[1] "pary wytartych bawełnianych rączek"
msgstr[2] "par wytartych bawełnianych rączek"
msgstr[3] "pary wytartych bawełnianych rączek"

#. ~ Description of "threadbare cotton arms"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"The spun cloth fingers are fraying away.  There's nothing that they could "
"hold on to."
msgstr ""
"Przędzone z materiału palce strzępią się. Nie ma niczego, czego mogłyby się "
"uchwycić."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "buttons and thread"
msgid_plural "buttons and thread"
msgstr[0] "zestaw guzików i nici"
msgstr[1] "zestawy guzików i nici"
msgstr[2] "zestawów guzików i nici"
msgstr[3] "zestawu guzików i nici"

#. ~ Description of "buttons and thread"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A pair of mismatched buttons and some dull yellow thread, to put on a brave "
"face with."
msgstr ""
"Para niedopasowanych guzików i trochę matowej żółtej nici, żeby z ich pomocą "
"nadrabiać miną."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid "10mm Auto JHP"
msgid_plural "10mm Auto JHP"
msgstr[0] "10 mm Auto JHP"
msgstr[1] "10 mm Auto JHP"
msgstr[2] "10 mm Auto JHP"
msgstr[3] "10 mm Auto JHP"

#. ~ Description of "10mm Auto JHP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid ""
"Jacketed 10mm Auto ammunition with a 180gr hollow point bullet, intended for "
"use in self-defense, or perhaps hunting.  The 10mm Auto cartridge is a rather"
" powerful handgun round and the progenitor to the more popular .40 S&W."
msgstr ""
"Amunicja 10 mm Auto ze 180 gr płaszczowym pociskiem wydrążonym, przeznaczona "
"do samoobrony lub ewentualnie polowań. Nabój 10 mm Auto to dość mocny nabój "
"do broni krótkiej i protoplasta bardziej popularnego kalibru .40 S&W."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid "10mm Auto +P"
msgid_plural "10mm Auto +P"
msgstr[0] "10 mm Auto +P"
msgstr[1] "10 mm Auto +P"
msgstr[2] "10 mm Auto +P"
msgstr[3] "10 mm Auto +P"

#. ~ Description of "10mm Auto +P"
#: data/json/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid ""
"'Full House' 10mm Auto ammunition with a 140gr solid copper penetrator "
"projectile, for hunting or self-defense from dangerous game.  The 10mm Auto "
"cartridge is a rather powerful handgun round and the progenitor to the more "
"popular .40 S&W."
msgstr ""
"Amunicja 10 mm Auto „Full House” ze 140 gr pociskiem penetrującym z litej "
"miedzi, do polowań lub samoobrony przed niebezpieczną zwierzyną. Nabój 10 mm "
"Auto to dość mocny nabój do broni krótkiej i protoplasta bardziej popularnego"
" kalibru .40 S&W."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid "10mm Auto FMJ, matchhead powder"
msgid_plural "10mm Auto FMJ, matchhead powder"
msgstr[0] "10 mm Auto FMJ, z prochem z zapałek"
msgstr[1] "10 mm Auto FMJ, z prochem z zapałek"
msgstr[2] "10 mm Auto FMJ, z prochem z zapałek"
msgstr[3] "10 mm Auto FMJ, z prochem z zapałek"

#. ~ Item name
