msgid ""
"Jacketed .30-06 Springfield M2 Ball ammunition with a 150gr spitzer bullet.  "
"The .30-06 cartridge was adopted in 1906 by the US military, where it served "
"for some 50 years, and it remains popular today among collectors and hunters "
"for its range, versatility, and power."
