msgid ""
".38 Super ammunition with a 124gr FMJ bullet.  The .38 Super round was "
"developed from .38 ACP in 1929 to penetrate body armor of the era.  The "
"caliber saw some resurgence in popularity among competition shooters in the "
"1980's prior to the proliferation of double stack 9mm pistols."
